==Battleground==
*20 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Mini White Cyclone]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Hannya]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage may look easy until you realize that Mini White Cyclone only has 1 knockback. You can try and freeze or slow the Mini White Cyclones, but it would be best to nuke it with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]].

===Recommended Units===
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Courier's anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] devastation is essential here, being a consistent and accessible counter against J.J. Jackrabbit, Ginger Snache and for finishing Hannya.
*[[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] - Used to deal heavy damage to Mini White Cyclone and chip other peons. Can be optionally used with [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]].
*[[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] - Only usable with "Research" Effect UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]], Boulder Cat can actually tank Mini White Cyclones for the full duration of its lifetime and prohibit them from pushing. It also comes into use against other peons and for stalling Hannya.
*[[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]] - Tanks Hannya very well and is also typed against Mini-Cyclone. He's not as effective against the Mini-Cyclone as he is against Hannya, but he still works. He benefits from Research combos, and pairs very well with Boulder because of this.
*[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] - Can be used to damage the J.J. Jackrabbits and Ginger Snaches, but never used alone.
*[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] - Valuable unit to tank Hannya here. Just handle the Mini White Cyclones.
*[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] - Does heavy damage against the Mini White Cyclones, and can be used to chip Hannya's health down.
*[[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] - An excellent unit to bring for some instant damage, and [[True Form]] gives him extra damage towards the J.J. Jackrabbits as a bonus.

==Trivia==
*Neutrino Snowlands is the first non-event stage to contain an [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]] and the first stage where an Advent Boss is above 100% strength magnification.

